  "name": "Furry Cruise",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "The Furry Cruise is an annual event, begun in 2005, in which furries book together as a group on a cruise ship. Many bring fursuits and entertain themselves and other passengers, and it is one of the few furry meets where most activities take place on a ship rather than on land. The first Furry Cruise, planned by LatinVixen, set sail from Miami in December 2005 with 37 furs aboard Royal Caribbean's Majesty of the Seas. Later cruises sailed with Royal Caribbean and Norwegian Cruise Line from Florida, Boston and Los Angeles, usually with 14 to 27 participants.",
